      "content": "You need to prepare a carefully crafted, proactive communication strategy to control the narrative immediately. A strong approach is to frame the decision as a complex financial necessity, rather than a direct attack on the community center. Focus the press release on your broader commitment to responsible fiscal management while acknowledging the importance of the facility to the community, perhaps by suggesting alternative, more sustainable funding in the future.",
