      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If the record is clean, lying about \"unsafe provisions\" is a high risk that will immediately undermine your credibility. In that scenario, you must dial back the excuse and carefully elaborate on the \"fiscal responsibility\" point with genuine, but carefully controlled, detail. Instead of a direct lie, frame the action as a \"prudent commitment to long-term financial stability,\" and then pivot the focus to your *next planned action* to seek private or alternative funding for the center.",
